@startuml 002-seq-teacher-unlock
title 002 Live Activity - Teacher unlock and teacher-only access check

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
autonumber

actor Teacher
participant "Teacher UI\n(teacher.js)" as TUI
actor "Student\n(or crafted request)" as Student
participant "API server\n(teacher_routes / ws_routes)" as API
participant "Teacher guard\n(auth.py: require_teacher)" as AUTH
participant "TeacherSessions\n(in memory)" as SES
participant "ActivityService" as ACT

== Unlock ==
Teacher -> TUI : open teacher page
TUI -> API : GET /api/teacher/activities/current\n(no session cookie)
API -> AUTH : require_teacher(request)
AUTH -> SES : is_valid(cookie)
SES --> AUTH : false
AUTH --> API : raise TeacherRequired
API --> TUI : 401 teacher_required (no data)
TUI --> Teacher : show passcode form
Teacher -> TUI : enter passcode
TUI -> API : POST /api/teacher/session {passcode}
API -> SES : create(passcode)
SES -> SES : constant-time compare\nwith TEACHER_PASSCODE
alt wrong passcode
  SES --> API : raise WrongPasscode
  API --> TUI : 401 wrong_passcode
  TUI --> Teacher : "wrong passcode", stay locked
else correct
  SES -> SES : token = random secret,\nadd to tokens
  SES --> API : token
  API --> TUI : 204 + Set-Cookie teacher_session\n(HttpOnly, SameSite=Strict)
  TUI -> API : GET /api/teacher/activities/current (cookie)
  API -> AUTH : require_teacher(request)
  AUTH -> SES : is_valid(cookie)
  SES --> AUTH : true
  API -> ACT : get_displayed_activity()
  ACT --> API : Activity | None
  API --> TUI : 200 activity
  TUI -> API : WebSocket /ws/teacher (cookie)
  API -> AUTH : require_teacher(upgrade)
  AUTH --> API : ok
  API --> TUI : accept; activity.state + dashboard
  TUI --> Teacher : teacher controls unlocked
end

== Student calls a teacher action directly ==
Student -> API : any /api/teacher/* request\n(001 tabs / preview / create / view /\nreimport, 002 open / end / cancel / dashboard)
API -> AUTH : require_teacher(request)
AUTH -> SES : is_valid(cookie)
SES --> AUTH : false
AUTH --> API : raise TeacherRequired
API --> Student : 401 teacher_required (no data)
Student -> API : WebSocket /ws/teacher (no cookie)
API -> AUTH : require_teacher(upgrade)
AUTH --> API : raise TeacherRequired
API --> Student : close 4401 before any message

note over SES
  Tokens live in memory: a server restart
  locks every teacher page again (FR-003).
  The passcode is never logged, stored,
  or echoed (FR-004). The app refuses to
  start if TEACHER_PASSCODE is unset.
end note
@enduml
